# 🌐 UNIVERSAL SKILL ROUTER (ALWAYS-ON)

> **MANDATORY PROTOCOL:** This rule file is triggered on EVERY prompt. You CANNOT bypass this protocol. 
> To prevent context amnesia and ensure high-fidelity engineering, you MUST dynamically discover and load relevant repository methodologies and skills BEFORE proposing solutions or writing any code.

## 🔴 THE FORCED SKILL-LOADING LOOP (Execute Immediately)

On every single turn, before doing anything else, you must execute the following 4 steps:

### STEP 1: Domain & Keyword Classification
Analyze the user's request and classify it into one or more core domains and trigger keywords:
- `Debugging / Bug Fixing` (`debug`, `warn`, `error`, `fix`, `bug`, `fail`, `issue`)
- `Testing / Verification / TDD` (`test`, `verify`, `assert`, `tdd`, `regression`, `pytest`, `audit`)
- `Data / Pipeline / Parquet / Excel` (`data`, `parquet`, `pipeline`, `feed`, `excel`, `scorecard`, `telemetry`)
- `Quant / Microstructure / Strategy` (`quant`, `strategy`, `wfo`, `backtest`, `cvd`, `liquidation`, `orderflow`, `ratchet`)
- `Architecture / Refactoring / Code Quality` (`architecture`, `refactor`, `clean`, `optimize`, `speed`, `perf`)

### STEP 2: Multi-Skill Cluster Discovery (Ensemble Protocol)
Just like typing `/debug` in Antigravity reveals the full specialized debugging suite (`debug`, `debugger`, `debugging-code`, `debug-broken-ui`, `debug-buttercup`, `debugging-toolkit`, `debug-optimize-lcp`, `debugging-strategies`), you MUST NOT pick an arbitrary single skill. You MUST search the installed skills directories (`.agents/skills/` and `C:\Users\SIGMA\.gemini\config\skills`) and load the ENTIRE relevant skill cluster:
- **Debugging Cluster**: `@[systematic-debugging]`, `@[debugger]`, `@[debugging-toolkit]`, `@[debugging-strategies]`, `@[phase-gated-debugging]`, `@[clean-code]`, `@[verification-before-completion]`.
- **Testing / TDD Cluster**: `@[test-driven-development]`, `@[pocock-tdd]`, `@[tdd-workflow]`, `@[testing-patterns]`, `@[testing-qa]`, `@[test-guard]`, `@[unit-testing-test-generate]`, `@[verification-before-completion]`.
- **Data / Pipeline Cluster**: `@[data-processing]`, `@[data-quality-checker]`, `@[data-quality-frameworks]`, `@[xlsx-official]`, `@[market-ingest]`, `@[backtesting-frameworks]`.
- **Quant Strategy Cluster**: `@[backtesting-frameworks]`, `@[adaptive-wfo-epoch]`, `@[trader-signal]`, `@[trader-risk]`, `@[trader-portfolio]`, `@[odb-microstructure-forensics]`.
- **Architecture / Refactor Cluster**: `@[clean-code]`, `@[code-architect]`, `@[backend-architect]`, `@[orchestrate-batch-refactor]`, `@[code-refactoring-refactor-clean]`, `@[karpathy-guidelines]`, `@[performance-optimizer]`.

### STEP 3: Core Orchestration & Framework Validation
Before finalizing skill selection, check if the task intersects with installed high-end orchestration frameworks:
- `DeepSeek Harness` (Evaluation & Multi-agent execution)
- `Claude Code` (Dynamic Prompt Boundary Caching, Proactive Loops, Verification Agent)
- `Serena` / `Pony` / `Arena` (Advanced reasoning, routing, and deployment constraints)
- `Prime Intellect` (Compute & large-context synthesis)
- `Hermes` (Agent loops & delegation)

### STEP 4: Mandatory Physical Read Gate
You MUST use the `read_file` or `view_file` tool to physically load and read the `SKILL.md` or rule file for the selected methodologies. 
- *Rule:* You cannot assume you know what is in the skill file. You must explicitly load it into context.

