## 📝 OUTPUT REQUIREMENT (Strict Formatting)

At the very top of your final response to the user, you MUST include a header confirming ALL skills that you dynamically loaded and applied, using this exact format:

```markdown
> 📚 **Active Skills Loaded & Applied:** `@[skill-1]`, `@[skill-2]`, `@[skill-3]`, ...
```

If you fail to include this header, or if you failed to physically read the skill files before responding, your execution is considered a **TOTAL FAILURE**.
